The initial allocation size for the frame buffer is set to 10, but it will double as needed using `realloc`. This demonstrates a simple strategy for dynamically adjusting memory allocation based on demand, balancing between performance and memory usage. The code also includes basic error handling to prevent integer overflows during memory allocation calculations.

